BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (Statutes ?468.8419 supplies concrete restrictions for regulated mold services. Build qualified specialist relationships so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (the fallback is controlled isolation and an orderly handoff, not improvised removal. Stop the affected activity when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (conditions exceed training or authorization, document why, and preserve safe site control. This protects the customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (and prevents a low-margin job from becoming an open-ended remediation liability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (The durable small-team moat is an operating system that converts field observations into accurate decisions, collectible) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (invoices, and fewer callbacks. Dispatch automation should route the right crew to the right hazard and geography, not) Tj ET
