BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (Action: Store a minimally necessary source snapshot with timestamps and a digest.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (Detail: Apply access controls and retention rules to snapshots; preserve the relationship between every derived field) Tj ET
