BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (Detail: Record discrepancies, test the fallback, restrict credentials to required permissions, and release only the verified) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (workflow to the pod.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 382.27 Tm (Start the waterfall with an authorized service inquiry, an existing customer relationship, or an internally defined) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 367.05 Tm (service-area monitoring task. Normalize the supplied address without replacing the original entry, then resolve the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.82 Tm (jurisdiction and candidate parcel. Match on multiple attributes: street number, normalized street, unit, municipality, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.60 Tm (parcel geometry where available. Shared driveways, condominium master parcels, and recently subdivided lots require) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 321.37 Tm (human review. Next attach hazard context with an explicit spatial relationship and event interval, not a binary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.15 Tm (damaged-property flag. Retrieve permits only when reconstruction planning needs them, and verify the licenses of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.92 Tm (actual assigned firms rather than similarly named businesses. Use contact enrichment last and only for a defined) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.70 Tm (operational purpose. Twilio Lookup can validate a customer-provided number's format and return purchased) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 260.47 Tm (intelligence; it does not identify the property's decision-maker or create permission for automated outreach. Avoid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.25 Tm (people-search waterfalls that infer residents from disaster footprints. Applicable 47 CFR 64.1200 requirements depend) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 230.02 Tm (on the communication technology, purpose, and consent facts. The dispatcher should see a small exception queue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.80 Tm (containing unresolved addresses, stale credentials, and missing authorization. They should not receive thousands of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.57 Tm (speculative leads that the field pod cannot service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 184.35 Tm (Use a compact data model that survives vendor changes. The core entities are job, property, event, party, authorization,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.12 Tm (observation, document, estimate version, cost entry, invoice, and payment. Give each an internal identifier; keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.90 Tm (vendor identifiers in a separate mapping table so a software migration does not rewrite job history. A source) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.67 Tm (observation needs source URL or resource identifier, retrieval time, event time, source revision, geographic precision,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 123.45 Tm (and the raw payload reference. Documents need their original filename, capture time when available, uploader, job) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 108.22 Tm (association, and cryptographic digest. A digest detects later byte changes; it does not prove that a photograph depicts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 93.00 Tm (the claimed location. Build connectors with Python stdlib urllib.request, json, csv, sqlite3, hashlib, and logging when a) Tj ET
